    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Creative collective and production studio based in Berlin, founded by Marius Jopen, Audrey Belaud, and Richard Keith. Members have backgrounds in graphic design (Jopen: Gerrit Rietveld graduate, worked at Sagmeister and Walsh, Bureau Mirko Borsche, Peter Schmidt Group), fine arts (Keith), and production (Belaud). THE PEOPLE funded their feature film Spacebirth 2 (2022, premiered Babylon Berlin) by doing client web and graphic design work. Studio-level operation: collectively takes its own projects and produces films, events, identities, and record covers. No LinkedIn found for the studio (search returned only unrelated companies); Marius Jopen personal LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/mariusjopen. thepeople.world serves a self-signed cert; netlify mirror (the-people-world.netlify.app) is the accessible version. Work captured from Poster Diary (2013-2015), Love Foundation identity posters, and Spagat record cover designs (Berlin music label). Autonomy 4 (inferred): independent collective, self-directed projects. Capabilities: Graphic design confirmed; film production and web design are additional unconfirmed disciplines, see Open Questions.",
